          <p>
            Two notes on reading it. Sole describes the TT8’s grade as "-6 to 15 levels" rather than
            percent, and older reviews and our own earlier pages give it as -6% to 15%; on Sole
            treadmills the two have usually matched, but Sole’s current page does not say so. And
            this site has found Sole’s published figures to differ between generations of the same
            model name before — the F80, F85 and <a href="/sole-f65-treadmill/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium" data-autolink>F65</a> all had that problem — so we have kept the
            older TT8’s figures out of this table entirely and set them out separately below.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="versions" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">3. Which Sole TT8? The Two Versions Sold Under the Name</h2>
<p>
            The TT8 has been on sale for many years, and the name has covered more than one machine.
            The frame, motor rating, deck size, speed, incline, decline and capacity have stayed the
            same across the versions we found. The console and the warranty have not.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[480px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Figure</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Current TT8 (Sole, 5 Nov 2026)</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Earlier TT8 (FitRated, Oct 2022)</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Console</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">15.6 in. touchscreen, Wi-Fi, wireless charging</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">10.1 in. TFT LCD, USB port, 10 programs</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Chest strap</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Not included</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Included</td></tr>
